# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kairo frontend (Vite) — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the same names on the Vercel project
# "kairo" (Production) for the deployed frontend.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── REQUIRED: backend API base URL ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Baked into the build at build time. No trailing slash.
VITE_API_URL="https://kairo-api-xi.vercel.app"

# ── REQUIRED: Clerk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Publishable key (pk_… / pk_test_…) — safe for the browser.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""

# ── NOT NEEDED — do not set on the frontend project ──────────────────────────
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY and POWERX_API_TOKEN were found on the "kairo" Vercel
# project but are unused there (the frontend never calls Clerk's backend API
# or PowerX directly). Safe to delete from Vercel for hygiene.
